        {
          "line": 158,
          "text": "    'and not adiabatic excitation energies. No configurational assignment (for example n->pi* labels) is asserted here, '"
        },
        {
          "line": 159,
          "text": "    'because the parsed oscillator strengths alone do not establish state character.'"
        },
        {
          "line": 160,
          "text": "    % (strong['state_index'], strong['energy_eV'], strong['fosc_length_gauge'],"
