        {
          "line": 162,
          "text": ""
        },
        {
          "line": 163,
          "text": "rationale = ('Managed ORCA input method line: %s ; TDDFT response block: %s . '"
        },
        {
          "line": 164,
          "text": "             'PBE0 (global hybrid, 25%% HF exchange) was selected for a bounded linear-response TDDFT treatment of valence '"
        },
        {
          "line": 165,
          "text": "             'singlet excitations of acetone, with the def2-SVP polarized valence double-zeta basis. Full TDDFT (not TDA) with '"
        },
        {
          "line": 166,
          "text": "             'NRoots 5 and singlets only was requested at the single prepared geometry under gas-phase (no solvent) conditions. '"
        },
        {
          "line": 167,
          "text": "             'Method and basis selection is a planning choice and is not independent scientific validation; the response block '"
